| Assignment requirement | Terraform implementation                      |
| ---------------------- | --------------------------------------------- |
| VPC                    | `aws_vpc`                                     |
| Public subnets         | `aws_subnet.public`                           |
| Private subnets        | `aws_subnet.private`                          |
| ALB SG                 | `aws_security_group.alb`                      |
| ECS SG                 | `aws_security_group.ecs`                      |
| RDS SG                 | `aws_security_group.rds`                      |
| ECS Cluster            | `aws_ecs_cluster`                             |
| Fargate                | `aws_ecs_task_definition` + `aws_ecs_service` |
| Application container  | `nginx:latest`                                |
| ALB                    | `aws_lb`                                      |
| ALB → ECS              | `aws_lb_target_group` + listener              |
| PostgreSQL             | `aws_db_instance`                             |
| RDS private            | `publicly_accessible = false`                 |
| RDS only from ECS      | RDS SG allows only ECS SG                     |
